---
import { BsMouse } from "react-icons/bs"
import ButtonCv from "../../ui/ButtonCv.astro"
---

<section
  class='relative flex flex-col items-center w-[1120px] max-lg:w-full min-h-[880px] py-40 max-lg:py-24 max-lg:px-8'
>
  <div
    class='mt-8 flex w-full gap-16 max-lg:flex-col max-lg:items-center max-lg:gap-12 max-lg:rows-2'
  >
    <!-- Columna de texto -->
    <div class='flex-1 space-y-6 max-lg:text-center'>
      <p
        class='flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-sm tracking-[0.3em] text-white/50 max-lg:justify-center'
      >
        <span class='h-px w-8 bg-light-green'></span>
        FULL STACK DEVELOPER
      </p>

      <h1
        class='font-Primary text-6xl max-sm:text-4xl font-bold leading-[0.95] text-white'
      >
        JEREMY<br />
        <span class='text-light-green'>
          AMARU<sup class='ml-1 align-super text-lg text-white/40'>®</sup>
        </span>
      </h1>

      <p class='max-w-[520px] text-secondary-text max-lg:mx-auto'>
        Transformo necesidades en soluciones digitales, creando aplicaciones web
        funcionales, eficientes y escalables desde el concepto hasta la puesta
        en producción.
      </p>

      <div class='flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 pt-2 max-lg:justify-center'>
        <a
          href='#Proyectos'
          class='rounded-full bg-light-green px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[#0b0b0d] transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-light-green'
        >
          Ver proyectos →
        </a>
        <ButtonCv initialText='Descargar CV' finalText='Descargar CV' />
      </div>

      <!-- Stats -->
      <div class='flex gap-10 pt-8 max-lg:justify-center'>
        <div>
          <span class='font-Primary block text-3xl font-bold text-white'
            >+6</span
          >
          <span class='text-xs tracking-wide text-white/40'
            >Proyectos desarrollados
          </span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class='font-Primary block text-3xl font-bold text-white'
            >+3</span
          >
          <span class='text-xs tracking-wide text-white/40'
            >Años de formación autodidacta</span
          >
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class='font-Primary block text-3xl font-bold text-white'>∞</span
          >
          <span class='text-xs tracking-wide text-white/40'
            >Ganas de aprender</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Foto -->
    <div class='relative max-lg:order-first'>
      <div
        class='absolute -inset-3 rounded-[2rem] border border-light-green/20'
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class='relative overflow-hidden rounded-[4.75rem] border border-white/10'
      >
        <img
          src='/images/IAM.png'
          alt='Foto Jeremy'
          class='max-lg:size-72 object-cover'
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    class='absolute bottom-0 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 py-10 text-white/40 max-lg:hidden'
  >
    <span class='font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em]'
      >DESLIZA PARA EXPLORAR</span
    >
    <div class='animate-bounce motion-reduce:animate-none'>
      <BsMouse size={26} />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

ponerlos en columnas y cambiar su posicion dependiendo de la resolucion de
pantalla, para que se vean bien en moviles y tablets.
